{"id":"024f9f6d-1dcd-4bba-874d-294876644df6","revision":0,"last_node_id":1025,"last_link_id":2028,"nodes":[{"id":1023,"type":"MarkdownNote","title":"TRIM CONTROLS","pos":[100,100],"size":[340,200],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["## Trim Controls (VHS_LoadVideo)\n\n- **skip_first_frames** — start frame (0 = beginning)\n- **frame_load_cap** — how many frames to load (0 = all)\n\nAt 24fps: 120 frames = 5s, 240 = 10s\n\n**For long videos:** set frame_load_cap=240 (10s) and run multiple times, incrementing skip_first_frames by 240 each time. Stitch in a video editor."],"color":"#3f789e"},{"id":1024,"type":"MarkdownNote","title":"OBESE STRENGTH","pos":[1600,100],"size":[340,180],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["## Obese Strength (ManualSigmas)\n\nChange the sigma values to control transformation:\n\n**Subtle:** `0.421875, 0.0`\n**Moderate:** `0.725, 0.421875, 0.0` ← default\n**Strong:** `0.909375, 0.725, 0.421875, 0.0`\n**Extreme:** `1.0, 0.909375, 0.725, 0.421875, 0.0`\n\nHigher starting sigma = more body transformation (but more identity drift)"],"color":"#6e3f89"},{"id":1025,"type":"MarkdownNote","title":"SPEED TIPS","pos":[100,320],"size":[340,160],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["## Speed Tips\n\n- Uses SamplerCustomAdvanced (3-4x faster than looping sampler)\n- Processes at 768px max → upscales to 1080p\n- Keep clips under 10s for best performance\n- Sigmas default = 3 steps (fast). Add more steps for quality."],"color":"#3f6e3f"},{"id":1001,"type":"VHS_LoadVideo","title":"Load Video (+ Trim)","pos":[100,500],"size":[360,280],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[{"name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","slot_index":0,"links":[2001]},{"name":"frame_count","type":"INT","slot_index":1,"links":[]},{"name":"audio","type":"AUDIO","slot_index":2,"links":[2028]},{"name":"video_info","type":"VHS_VIDE